Adapted from Armature:
- backend/internal/db: internal/db, the cluster, read routing and LSN pinning
- backend/internal/freshness: internal/freshness, the read-your-writes tracker
- deploy/charts/stator: deploy/charts/armature, its helpers, the CNPG cluster,
  the bundled Postgres and Valkey, and the roles, secrets, migrate and seed Jobs
- backend/internal/objectstore: the S3 client of internal/attachment
- backend/internal/attachment, attachment_handlers.go and migration 00080:
  internal/attachment (service, reaper, tombstones), the attachment
  handlers, ParseSize and ARMATURE_UPLOAD_LIMIT from internal/config, and
  migrations 00015, 00016 and 00900
- backend/internal/theme and its migrations: internal/theme, migrations
  00050_themes, 00902_org_default_theme and 00906_theme_names_per_organization
- backend/internal/httpapi/theme_handlers.go: the theme handlers and routes
- backend/internal/document: the document validation and plain text of
  internal/issue/document.go
- web/src/lib/theme-tokens.ts, theme-css.ts, constellation.ts, confetti.ts
- web/src/features/themes: ThemeLoader, BackdropEffect, ThemeEditor
- web/src/features/editor: Editor, Toolbar, MentionList, DocView, schema
  and their tests, from web/src/features/editor
- web/src/routes/themes.tsx and theme-editor.tsx
- web/src/components/ui: controls, Field, ColorField, Card, Segmented, Tabs,
  Tag, SectionTitle, Table and Choice
- backend/internal/auth: password.go, token.go, model.go and service.go from
  internal/auth (argon2id passwords, sessions, switching organizations)
- backend/internal/oidc: internal/oidc (provider, sign-in flow, group sync,
  the backchannel issuer rewrite), with PKCE and matching by subject added
- migrations 00010 to 00012: user_group, group_member, oidc_provider,
  oidc_login and user_session from 00001_foundation, 00010_rbac,
  00044_session_proof and 00905_sso_reaches_its_provider
- backend/internal/httpapi/auth_handlers.go and oidc_handlers.go: the sign-in,
  session and provider handlers and routes
- backend/internal/auth/joinrequests.go, backend/internal/audit and migration
  00013: internal/auth/joinrequests.go, internal/audit and migrations
  00901_sso_join_requests and the audit_log of 00001_foundation
- web/src/features/auth: the sign-in form, ProviderSettings and JoinRequests
- backend/internal/auth/tokens.go, token_handlers.go and migration 00040: the
  personal access tokens of internal/auth/tokens_admin.go and service.go,
  the api_token of 00001_foundation, and the readOnlyToken middleware
- backend/internal/openapi/validate.go and backend/test/contract_test.go,
  endpoints_test.go and zz_coverage_test.go: the response validation and
  the operation coverage of Armature's integration suite
- web/src/routes/tokens.tsx: web/src/routes/tokens.tsx
- backend/internal/space/space.go: ValidKey, NormalizeKey and SuggestKey from
  internal/project/project.go, the shape of a project key
- backend/internal/rank: internal/rank, the lexicographic ranks that order
  siblings, with Spread added
- web/src/features/search/QuickSearch.tsx: the keyboard handling, the
  listbox and the Ctrl K shortcut of features/palette/CommandPalette.tsx
- backend/internal/events, internal/notify, internal/mail and migrations
  00150 to 00152: internal/events (Emit, the outbox table and its claim with
  SKIP LOCKED), internal/notify (the fan-out, preferences and digest) and
  internal/mail, and migrations 00001_foundation (outbox_event),
  00032_notifications and 00040_outbox_trace
- backend/internal/netguard: internal/netguard, the SSRF guard, with Names
  and a transport of its own for the Armature backchannel
- backend/internal/webhook, webhook_handlers.go, migration 00290 and
  web/src/features/webhooks: internal/webhook (endpoints, deliveries one row
  per attempt, Sign and Verify, the backoff, the sender, test and
  redelivery), the webhook handlers and routes, webhook_endpoint and
  webhook_delivery of migration 00033_automation, and
  web/src/routes/webhooks.tsx, with sealed secrets, owners, leases and
  turning a failing endpoint off added
- backend/cmd/armature-stub: the signature of internal/webhook (Sign) and
  the envelope and headers Armature posts; api/armature/openapi.json is
  Armature's own document, unchanged
- backend/internal/httpapi/mcp.go, mcp_tools.go and mcp_test.go, and
  backend/internal/openapi/standalone.go: the MCP endpoint, its tool
  catalogue drawn from the route table and its tests, from
  internal/httpapi/mcp.go, mcp_tools.go and internal/openapi/standalone.go,
  with tools for read-only tokens filtered and multipart tools added
- backend/internal/comment/service.go: the edit and delete rules of
  internal/issue/comments.go, where only the author rewrites a comment and an
  administrator may remove anybody's; Stator deletes softly and threads them
- render/server.mjs, deploy/Dockerfile.render, backend/internal/render and
  backend/internal/httpapi/pdf_handlers.go and throttle.go: render/server.mjs,
  deploy/Dockerfile.render, internal/render, the PDF handlers of
  internal/httpapi/pdf_handlers.go and the throttle of
  portal_entry_handlers.go, with a credential for the page's API calls, a
  concurrency limit, a size limit and a running header and footer added, and
  the render templates of deploy/charts/armature in deploy/charts/stator
